NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000247 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000248 "=head1 HISTORY"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000249 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000250 "Version 3 is a significant update to provide support for versions of"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000251 "Perl later than Perl 5.004. Specifically, the XS version of the"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000252 "soundex() subroutine understands strings that are encoded using UTF-8"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000253 "(unicode strings)."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000254 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000255 "Version 2 of this module was a re-write by Mark Mielke (C<mark@mielke.cc>)"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000256 "to improve the speed of the subroutines. The XS version of the soundex()"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000257 "subroutine was introduced in 2.00."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000258 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000259 "Version 1 of this module was written by Mike Stok (C<mike@stok.co.uk>)"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000260 "and was included into the Perl core library set."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000261 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000262 "Dave Carlsen (C<dcarlsen@csranet.com>) made the request for the NARA"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000263 "algorithm to be included. The NARA soundex page can be viewed at:"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000264 "C<http://www.archives.gov/research/census/soundex.html>"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000265 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000266 "Ian Phillips (C<ian@pipex.net>) and Rich Pinder (C<rpinder@hsc.usc.edu>)"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000267 "supplied ideas and spotted mistakes for v1.x."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000268 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000269 "=cut"
BODY_END
